  "html": "<div class=\"row\"><div class=\"col col-8\"><h2>Flat Panel Fabric Laminator</h2><figure><img src=\"/uploads/2016/07/CA-Flat-Panel-Fabric-Laminator-b-1.jpg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\"></figure><div class=\"center\">\n\t\t\t<ul>\n<li>Automated flat panel lamination of glass or carbon fabric pre-preg</li>\n<li>Dual tables for continuous lamination operation</li>\n<li>Compacts with each successive ply</li>\n<li>Single ply laminated in 20 seconds or less</li>\n</ul>\n</div></div><div class=\"col col-4\">\n\t\t\t<nav class=\"side-nav\"><h3 class=\"widget-title\">Cross Ply &amp; Fabric Lamination</h3><ul><li><a href=\"/composites-automation/cross-ply-fabric-lamination/variable-angle-2-ply-laminator/\">Variable-Angle, 2-Ply Laminator</a></li><li class=\"current\"><a href=\"/composites-automation/cross-ply-fabric-lamination/flat-panel-fabric-laminator/\">Flat Panel Fabric Laminator</a></li><li><a href=\"/composites-automation/cross-ply-fabric-lamination/variable-angle-ply-laminator-i/\">Variable Angle Ply Laminator I</a></li><li><a href=\"/composites-automation/cross-ply-fabric-lamination/variable-angle-ply-laminator-ii/\">Variable Angle Ply Laminator II</a></li></ul></nav>\n</div></div><h3>Machine Images</h3><div class=\"gallery\"><a href=\"/uploads/2016/07/CA-Flat-Panel-Fabric-Laminator-b-1.jpg\"><img src=\"/uploads/2016/07/CA-Flat-Panel-Fabric-Laminator-b-1-300x226.jpg\" alt=\"\" width=\"300\" height=\"226\" loading=\"lazy\"></a><a href=\"/uploads/2016/07/CA-Flat-Panel-Fabric-Laminator-a.jpg\"><img src=\"/uploads/2016/07/CA-Flat-Panel-Fabric-Laminator-a-300x235.jpg\" alt=\"\" width=\"300\" height=\"235\" loading=\"lazy\"></a></div>"
